{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈……噗嗯」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2115", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……早上好，少爷」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2116", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "感觉到嘴唇被覆盖着，我睁开眼就看到安洁微笑着俯视我，她的脸是倒过来的。", "text_idx": 258, "plain": "感觉到嘴唇被覆盖着，我睁开眼就看到安洁微笑着俯视我，她的脸是倒过来的。", "plain_idx": 258, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我立刻就明白了——\\n头下枕着的不是枕头，是安洁柔软的大腿。", "text_idx": 259, "plain": "我立刻就明白了——头下枕着的不是枕头，是安洁柔软的大腿。", "plain_idx": 260, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈哈」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "比起早上的问候，我先不自觉地笑了出来。", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「早上好……安洁，没想到你连这种技能都学会了」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": "「早上好……安洁，没想到你连这种技能都学会了」", "plain_idx": 263, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "用自己的腿代替枕头让我枕上，还用亲吻叫醒我。", "text_idx": 264, "plain": "用自己的腿代替枕头让我枕上，还用亲吻叫醒我。", "plain_idx": 264, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……说起来，这也是“ToDo计划表”上写着的事」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": "「……说起来，这也是“ToDo计划表”上写着的事」", "plain_idx": 265, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这样做有让你在起来的时候感到舒服吗……？」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2117", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……安洁的吻和腿都很舒服哦……」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁也很舒服……」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2118", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「能感受到少爷的体温和重量，用大腿给您当枕头，真的很……」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": "「能感受到少爷的体温和重量，用大腿给您当枕头，真的很……」", "plain_idx": 271, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2119", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喜欢？」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的……最喜欢了」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2120", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「少爷……最喜欢了……嗯」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2121", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁弯下身又吻了过来。", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她这么做的话，果然，那柔软的胸今天也包住了我的头。", "text_idx": 279, "plain": "她这么做的话，果然，那柔软的胸今天也包住了我的头。", "plain_idx": 279, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被柔软上下夹击的亲吻。", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼……」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2122", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "亲吻结束后，安洁的笑容就变得娇柔了。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也是，睡得这么舒服，已经不是迷糊了，是快要融化在这了……", "text_idx": 284, "plain": "我也是，睡得这么舒服，已经不是迷糊了，是快要融化在这了……", "plain_idx": 284, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「少爷，你头发睡乱了」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2123", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我来帮你整理一下……咻咻♪」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2124", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈哈，我的头发本来就这样」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「少爷的头发很柔软，安洁我很喜欢哦？」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2125", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不对不对，光滑的脸蛋、鼻子、还有额头也……」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2126", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁怜爱地摸着我的头发和脸。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": "安洁怜爱地摸着我的头发和脸。", "plain_idx": 294, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这样的爱抚……真正的爱抚应该就是这样的吧。", "text_idx": 295, "plain": "这样的爱抚……真正的爱抚应该就是这样的吧。", "plain_idx": 295, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我觉得就是这样。", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是因为想这样亲热，才稍微早点叫醒了我吧，哈哈」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": "「就是因为想这样亲热，才稍微早点叫醒了我吧，哈哈」", "plain_idx": 297, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「被少爷看穿了吗？！」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2127", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为我的女仆非常能干」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2128", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼呼……这都是因为安洁有了个非常非常棒的少爷哦～♪」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": "「呼呼……这都是因为安洁有了个非常非常棒的少爷哦～♪」", "plain_idx": 303, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2129", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，这样好痒」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为安洁很能干，所以被发现了也不会放弃的哦～」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2130", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——就这样，我们从一早上开始就充满活力地互相戏谑。", "text_idx": 308, "plain": "——就这样，我们从一早上开始就充满活力地互相戏谑。", "plain_idx": 308, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后当我起来的时候，感觉全身都已经醒过来了。", "text_idx": 309, "plain": "然后当我起来的时候，感觉全身都已经醒过来了。", "plain_idx": 309, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔～嗯……这就是安洁的效果吗……」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了！感觉今天的状态非常好」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵，那真是太好了」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2131", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
