{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「正因如此，才是展示实力的时候」", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0999", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哦哦，樱乃同学非常有干劲呢」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2136", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总而言之先避免不及格」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1000", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「目标好低？！」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2137", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「与其说是展示实力，不如说是单纯不想露出马脚吧……」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": "「与其说是展示实力，不如说是单纯不想露出马脚吧……」", "plain_idx": 342, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，大家～早上好」", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0421", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜！」", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0117", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「早上好。熊喵也早上好」", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「考试开始的早上我总感觉有些紧张呢——」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0422", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说得没错。\\n　我早已各种紧张了」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": "「说得没错。　我早已各种紧张了」", "plain_idx": 354, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2138", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「和叫我哥起来的时候一样吗」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1001", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈哈哈，那就不只是今天是这样了呢～」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2139", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼呼，两位关系真是好」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0423", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「对了，瓜生。我记得之前说过期末结束后大家要一起开庆功宴……」", "text_idx": 362, "plain": "「对了，瓜生。我记得之前说过期末结束后大家要一起开庆功宴……」", "plain_idx": 362, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0424", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、是的」", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这次是不是要和菜菜慢慢过？」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0425", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……天羽学姐」", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「最初的时候最关键哦。是吧——小熊喵」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0426", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜溜～」", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0118", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哦、哦？在说什么事情？\\n　请让安洁也参与进去」", "text_idx": 372, "plain": "「哦、哦？在说什么事情？　请让安洁也参与进去」", "plain_idx": 373, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2140", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在说考试的第一天非常重要哦。\\n　好嘞，我也要加油了」", "text_idx": 375, "plain": "「在说考试的第一天非常重要哦。　好嘞，我也要加油了」", "plain_idx": 376, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0427", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「考试的时候我说我要回各务台不知道行不行得通？」", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0359", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你这是逃避吧」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「确实是这样，所以得下定决心呢」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0360", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁现在怎么样？这次能行吗？」", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0361", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，虽然还是没有什么自信……」", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2141", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，为了不让少爷蒙羞，安洁会拼尽全力的」", "text_idx": 387, "plain": "「但是，为了不让少爷蒙羞，安洁会拼尽全力的」", "plain_idx": 387, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2142", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哦，真有气势。正闪闪发光着呢」", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0362", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也要为了女朋友努力了…… \\n　这么一想，考试好像也能燃起来了」", "text_idx": 391, "plain": "「我也要为了女朋友努力了…… 　这么一想，考试好像也能燃起来了」", "plain_idx": 392, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0363", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哦，隼太也有干劲了……\\n　乾同学怎么说？」", "text_idx": 394, "plain": "「哦，隼太也有干劲了……　乾同学怎么说？」", "plain_idx": 395, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈哈哈，小乾的应该就是为了学姐吧？」", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0364", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不要和我搭话你们这群臭虫！\\n　好不容易记住的东西都要忘了，快滚！」", "text_idx": 399, "plain": "「不要和我搭话你们这群臭虫！　好不容易记住的东西都要忘了，快滚！」", "plain_idx": 400, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0376", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「杀气满满呢。\\n　真让人害怕，抖抖抖抖」", "text_idx": 403, "plain": "「杀气满满呢。　真让人害怕，抖抖抖抖」", "plain_idx": 404, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2143", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4083", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这边散发出的是冷酷而敏锐的气场吗？！」", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2144", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「别把我说得像是个冷血的人一样好吗」", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4084", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，这次和之前不同，我基本上可以一个人集中精力了」", "text_idx": 413, "plain": "「嗯，这次和之前不同，我基本上可以一个人集中精力了」", "plain_idx": 413, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4085", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「确实，爱理同学考前一贯都是这样的」", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2145", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「原来之前那次真的是特别的……」", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那肯定的。\\n　你们之后每天也有那么做吧？」", "text_idx": 418, "plain": "「那肯定的。　你们之后每天也有那么做吧？」", "plain_idx": 419, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4086", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2146", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……听你这么一说感觉开始紧张起来了」", "text_idx": 422, "plain": "「……听你这么一说感觉开始紧张起来了」", "plain_idx": 422, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
